      "customData": {
        "kind": "canvas",
        "title": "Three scopes, not three departmental wallets",
        "description": "Cost centers draw from the shared included pool. A separate cost-center included-usage control has a cap automatically based on member licenses and can block or permit paid overage subject to policy. A cost-center metered budget limits paid overage, not a reserved allocation of included credits."
